---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Products
description: A modular scientific software ecosystem — simulation, engineering UI, visualization, and core platform components you can license, customize, or build on. Filter and browse all Extropian products.
extraScripts:
  - https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js
  - https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/ScrambleTextPlugin.min.js
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <h1 data-scramble>Products</h1>
  <p class="lede">A modular scientific software ecosystem. Every component is designed to be licensed as-is, customized for your workflow, or used as the foundation for a larger engineering project. Filter to find the right building block, then open its page for the full technical picture.</p>
</header>

<section class="wrap section-block" id="browse">
  {%- from "partials/product-browser.njk" import productBrowser %}
  {{ productBrowser(collections.productsByOrder, 'pb-all', false) }}
</section>

<section class="wrap section-block" id="all">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Every product, one click away</h2>
    <p class="normal">Prefer reading? Each product has a dedicated page with capabilities, technical foundation, and licensing details.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="chip-row" style="justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap">
    {%- for item in collections.productsByOrder %}
    <a class="chip" href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section-block" id="custom">
  <div class="section-top">
    <h2>Don't see what you need?</h2>
    <p class="normal">Products are extended and combined for each engagement — custom development is part of the model.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="button button--primary" href="/engineering/">Engineering &amp; licensing</a>
  </div>
</section>
